@startuml Reset_Password
title Activity Diagram - Reset User Password

|Admin|
start
:Select a user;
:Click "Reset Password";
:Enter new password;
:Confirm new password;
:Click "Reset";

|Web Application|
:Validate input data;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  :Display validation error;
  stop
endif

:Send password reset data\nto backend;

|Backend API|
:Extract admin ID\nfrom JWT token;
:Call UserService.\nUpdateUserAsync(userId, request, adminId, isAdmin);
:Check if user exists;
if (User not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  stop
endif

:Check authorization\n(Admin only);
if (Unauthorized?) then (yes)
  :Return 403 Forbidden;
  stop
endif

:Hash new password using BCrypt;
:Update user entity:\nSet PasswordHash = {hashedPassword};
:Save changes to database;
:Get updated user with role information;
:Return UserResponseDto;
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message\n"Password reset successfully";
  :Refresh user list;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Admin|
:View confirmation message;
stop
@enduml



